      "label": "Static Asset Resolution (resolveStaticAssetPath & answerStaticAsset)",
      "file_type": "code",
      "rationale": "Owns path prefix, index, traversal refusal, and response headers before middleware and routes without enhancers; host supplies only the file opener.",
