      "id": "packages_platform_core_agents_platform_capabilities",
      "label": "Platform Capability Contract (requirePlatformCapabilities)",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Feature packages contribute neutral artifacts and state required capabilities; boot refuses missing request-path capabilities with UNSUPPORTED_PLATFORM_FEATURE instead of per-platform allowlists.",
