      "label": "APP_* Pseudo-Providers",
      "file_type": "concept",
      "rationale": "Exempt from duplicate-token checks, execute in declaration order, resolve in the declaring module without empty-constructor fallback (raising MISSING_PROVIDER if missing), and disallow direct token lookup.",
